OL,3,A'Get in' - woman joins police chase by
OL,4,Agiving officer a lift in Nissan Micra
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver came to the aid of a police
OL,7,Fofficer who was chasing a suspect on
OL,8,Ffoot - telling him to "get in" after
OL,9,Fstopping her Nissan Micra and offering
OL,10,Fhim a lift.
OL,12,FThe officer had been pursuing Jacob
OL,13,FRoberts, 25, who had reverse-rammed a
OL,14,Fpolice car twice and crashed into
OL,15,Fparked cars and a building while trying
OL,16,Fto escape.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
