OL,3,A'Get in' - woman joins police chase by
OL,4,Agiving officer a lift in Nissan Micra
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoberts sped away from officers who had
OL,7,Fsmelled cannabis coming from his van,
OL,8,Fwith the chase seeing him drive in an
OL,9,Ferratic manner, failing to stop at
OL,10,Fmultiple junctions, mounting pavements
OL,11,Fand putting pedestrians at risk.
OL,13,FThe driver helped PC Kerswell catch up
OL,14,Fto Roberts, who was arrested and later
OL,15,Fjailed for one year and two months for
OL,16,Fa number of driving offences.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
